<section class="schedule" id="horarios">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge">Horarios</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">ENCUENTRA TU <span>HORARIO IDEAL</span></h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Ofrecemos horarios flexibles para que puedas combinar el entrenamiento con tu vida académica o laboral.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="schedule-tabs">
      <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="bogota">Bogotá</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="medellin">Medellín</button>
      <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="cali">Cali</button>
    </div>

    <div class="schedule-content">
      <div class="tab-panel active" id="bogota">
        <div class="schedule-table-wrap">
          <table class="schedule-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Programa</th><th>Lunes - Miércoles</th><th>Martes - Jueves</th><th>Sábados</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag mini">Minibasket</span></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 9:00 AM<br /><small>3:00 PM - 4:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 9:00 AM<br /><small>3:00 PM - 4:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>9:00 AM - 11:00 AM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag juvenil">Juvenil</span></td>
                <td>4:00 PM - 6:00 PM<br /><small>6:30 PM - 8:30 PM</small></td>
                <td>4:00 PM - 6:00 PM<br /><small>6:30 PM - 8:30 PM</small></td>
                <td>2:00 PM - 4:30 PM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag elite">Elite</span></td>
                <td>6:00 AM - 8:00 AM<br /><small>7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>6:00 AM - 8:00 AM<br /><small>7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 11:00 AM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag clinic">Skills Clinic</span></td>
                <td colspan="2" class="center">Consultar disponibilidad</td>
                <td>8:00 AM – 12:00 PM</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="schedule-note">
          <span>ℹ️</span>
          <p>Los horarios pueden variar en temporadas de vacaciones y festivos. Consulta con tu sede el calendario actualizado.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="medellin">
        <div class="schedule-table-wrap">
          <table class="schedule-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Programa</th><th>Lunes - Miércoles</th><th>Martes - Jueves</th><th>Sábados</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag mini">Minibasket</span></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 9:00 AM<br /><small>3:30 PM - 4:30 PM</small></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 9:00 AM<br /><small>3:30 PM - 4:30 PM</small></td>
                <td>9:00 AM - 11:00 AM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag juvenil">Juvenil</span></td>
                <td>4:30 PM - 6:30 PM</td>
                <td>4:30 PM - 6:30 PM</td>
                <td>2:00 PM - 4:30 PM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag elite">Elite</span></td>
                <td>6:00 AM - 8:00 AM<br /><small>7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>6:00 AM - 8:00 AM<br /><small>7:00 PM - 9:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 11:00 AM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag clinic">Skills Clinic</span></td>
                <td colspan="2" class="center">Consultar disponibilidad</td>
                <td>9:00 AM – 1:00 PM</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="schedule-note"><span>ℹ️</span><p>Consulta con nuestra sede de Medellín para horarios especiales y clases de recuperación.</p></div>
      </div>

      <div class="tab-panel" id="cali">
        <div class="schedule-table-wrap">
          <table class="schedule-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Programa</th><th>Lunes - Miércoles</th><th>Martes - Jueves</th><th>Sábados</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag mini">Minibasket</span></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 9:00 AM<br /><small>3:00 PM - 4:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>8:00 AM - 9:00 AM<br /><small>3:00 PM - 4:00 PM</small></td>
                <td>9:00 AM - 11:00 AM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag juvenil">Juvenil</span></td>
                <td>4:00 PM - 6:00 PM</td>
                <td>4:00 PM - 6:00 PM</td>
                <td>2:00 PM - 5:00 PM</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><span class="prog-tag elite">Elite</span></td>
                <td>6:00 AM - 8:00 AM<br /><small>6:30 PM - 8:30 PM</small></td>
                <td>6:00 AM - 8:00 AM<br /><small>6:30 PM - 8:30 PM</small></td>
                <td>7:30 AM - 10:30 AM</td>
